# `apps/api` (`@proxed/api`)

Core proxy service running on Bun using Hono.

## Key entry points

- App bootstrap: `apps/api/src/index.ts`
- Routers: `apps/api/src/rest/routers.ts` and `apps/api/src/rest/routes/*`
- Middleware: `apps/api/src/rest/middleware/*`
- tRPC: `apps/api/src/trpc/*` (internal RPC for dashboard)
- Provider-specific helpers: `apps/api/src/utils/*`

## Conventions

- Use Hono patterns (not Next.js) and keep middleware order intentional.
- Security: enforce auth + DeviceCheck for iOS requests; never leak provider keys.
- Streaming responses should go through existing stream utilities (don't reinvent SSE parsing).
- Prefer structured errors via `apps/api/src/utils/errors.ts` and keep error responses consistent.
- Use `@proxed/db` for database access (Drizzle ORM).

